    "\n- EODHD: free 20 calls/day and 20 requests/minute; no fundamentals. FMP: 250 free calls/day, with endpoint/symbol limitations; its free tier must not be described as unrestricted quarterly fundamentals. Twelve Data: Basic 8 credits/minute, 800/day; no full statements. Links in paid comparison below.\n\n## Low-cost paid shortlist (USD, before any tax/additional license costs)\n1. FMP Premium: $49/month equivalent, billed annually ($588/year); pricing displays $69 as the monthly comparator. 750 calls/minute, 50 GB trailing-30-day bandwidth, full fundamentals, up to 30 years. Starter $19/month annual-billed is annual fundamentals, so insufficient as the only TTM engine. Premium's US/UK/Canada coverage does not prove every foreign issuer/ADR field; test TSM and NBIS specifically. Pricing explicitly requires a separate Data Display and Licensing Agreement for displaying or redistributing FMP data. ",
    "\n- EODHD：免費方案每日 20 次呼叫、每分鐘 20 次請求；不含基本面。FMP：每日 250 次免費呼叫，但有端點／股票代號限制；不可將其免費層描述為不受限制的季度基本面。Twelve Data：Basic 每分鐘 8 點、每日 800 點；不含完整報表。連結見下方付費比較。\n\n## 低成本付費候選（USD，未計任何稅金／額外授權成本）\n1. FMP Premium：年繳等值每月 $49（每年 $588）；定價顯示月繳比較價格為 $69。每分鐘 750 次呼叫、過去 30 日 50 GB 頻寬、完整基本面、最長 30 年。Starter 年繳每月 $19 僅含年度基本面，因此不足以單獨作為 TTM 引擎。Premium 的美國／英國／加拿大涵蓋範圍，不代表每家外國發行人／ADR 欄位均有資料；應特別測試 TSM 與 NBIS。定價明確要求展示或再散布 FMP 資料時另簽 Data Display and Licensing Agreement。 "
