    "ta.sec.gov/submissions/CIK##########.json. Preserve a filing's original accession, accepted timestamp and primary document. Use SEC original filing when standard tags are missing or ambiguous.\n- Raw files are immutable, keyed by accession and checksum. Current/latest views are derived. Cache lookup lists 24 hours; check submissions periodically server-side and fetch companyfacts when filing history changes. Do not report a refresh as successful merely because an old cached response loaded.\n- “As of” historical valuations must filter acceptance <= decision time before selecting facts. Later restatements/comparative numbers cannot enter a historical run. Current companyfacts alone is not a point-in-time database. Preserve original as-filed contexts, units and accession.\n- Income/cash-flow duration facts require fiscal start/end matching. Never sum four YTD facts. Build discrete Q2/Q3 from same-year cumulative differences when appropriate, Q4 = FY minus 9M; TTM = four nonoverlapping quarters or FY + current YTD - prior-year comparable YTD. Store component references and formula. Balance sheets use latest instant, never a sum.\n- Companyfacts frames are not sufficient to infer issuer fiscal quarters. Different issuers have noncalendar and 52/53-week fiscal years. Fiscal year labels can differ from year in period-end dates.\n- Do not fabricate EBITDA, capex, debt, working capital or tax rates when a concept is missing. Define cash versus short-term investments, gross debt versus net debt, and treatment of lease liabilities explicitly. Null means unavailable; reported zero is zero. Store source tags and all adjustments.\n- Use current outstanding economic shares for current per-share equity value; weighted-average diluted shares are a different accounting measure. Preserve both and distinguish class-level from issuer-total shares. Alphabet and Meta need class-aware identity. Compare price and share basis after splits without double adjustment.\n- TSM requires reporting-currency versus USD ADR price reconciliation and a verified depositary ratio. Never simply divide TWD equity value by ADR count or ordinary-share value by ADR price. NBIS requires checking latest issuer form/taxonomy and continuing-operation comparability after its restructuring. Do not assume foreign private issuers have quarterly 10-Q data; obtain issuer releases/6-K as needed, or label annual-only.\n- A vendor-normalized quarterly response may not guarantee point-in-time history. Check filing dates and original source, preserve missing values and provider adjustments. EODHD documents yearly/quarterly Financials and filing_date, currency_symbol and shares history, but this is not proof of historical vintage integrity: ",
    "ta.sec.gov/submissions/CIK##########.json。保留申報文件原始 accession、受理時間戳記與主要文件。標準標籤缺失或有歧義時，使用 SEC 原始申報文件。\n- 原始檔案不可變更，主鍵採 accession 與校驗碼。目前／最新檢視由原始檔案推導。查詢清單快取 24 小時；在伺服器端定期檢查 submissions，申報歷史變更時再取得 companyfacts。不可僅因載入舊快取回應，就回報更新成功。\n- 歷史「截至某日」估值必須先以 acceptance <= decision time 篩選，再選取事實資料。後來重編／比較數據不可進入歷史執行。僅有目前 companyfacts 並不是時間點資料庫。保留原始申報時的 contexts、單位與 accession。\n- 損益／現金流量期間事實資料需匹配會計期間起訖日。絕不可將四個 YTD 數值相加。適當時，以同年度累計差額建立單季 Q2／Q3；Q4 = FY 減 9M；TTM = 四個不重疊季度，或 FY + 本期 YTD - 前一年可比 YTD。儲存組成參考與公式。資產負債表使用最新時點值，不可加總。\n- Companyfacts frames 不足以推定發行人會計季度。不同發行人有非曆年及 52/53 週會計年度。會計年度標籤可能與期末日期年份不同。\n- 概念缺失時，不可虛構 EBITDA、資本支出、債務、營運資金或稅率。明確定義現金與短期投資、總債務與淨債務，以及租賃負債處理方式。Null 表示無法取得；已公布的零才是零。儲存來源標籤及所有調整。\n- 目前每股股權價值採目前流通經濟股數；加權平均稀釋股數是不同的會計衡量。兩者均保留，並區分類別層級與發行人總股數。Alphabet 與 Meta 需要辨識股份類別。股票分割後，比較價格與股數基礎時不得重複調整。\n- TSM 需要調節報表幣別與 USD ADR 價格，並驗證存託比率。不可直接將 TWD 股權價值除以 ADR 數量，或將普通股價值除以 ADR 價格。NBIS 需要檢查最新發行人表格／分類法，以及重整後繼續營業業務的可比性。不可假設外國私人發行人有季度 10-Q 資料；依需要取得發行人新聞稿／6-K，或標示僅有年度資料。\n- 供應商正常化季度回應不一定保證時間點歷史完整性。檢查申報日期與原始來源，保留缺失值與供應商調整。EODHD 文件記載年度／季度 Financials、filing_date、currency_symbol 與股數歷史，但這不是歷史版本完整性的證明： "
