    "l-apis/stock-etfs-fundamental-data-feeds\n\n## UI/contract requirements\nUse /api/companies?query= and /api/company/:symbol?asOf=... on an owned backend, or a prebuilt static cache clearly labeled snapshot. Browser never receives provider secrets. Validate symbols server-side; no open arbitrary-URL proxy. Provider-specific CORS not established except SEC's explicit no-CORS; backend avoids that dependency and controls licensing/cache policy.\n\nEach numeric field: value (number|null), unit/currency, periodStart, periodEnd, periodType (FY/Q/TTM/instant), filedAt, acceptedAt, accession, form, sourceUrl, sourceTag, status (reported/derived/missing/conflict), derivation and components. Identity: symbol, cik, exchange, securityType, reportingCurrency, quoteCurrency, shareClass, ordinarySharesPerDepositaryShare and verification source.\n\nSeparate quote.priceAsOf from financial periodEnd and from fetchedAt. Include lastSuccessfulRefreshAt, latestFilingCheckedAt, nextCheckAt, cacheAge, provider, providerLicenseMode, status and missingFields. Quote: price nullable, raw/adjusted basis, currency, timestamp, delay, source URL. Never label old snapshots live or current simply because fetched today.\n\nQuality flags: annual_only, ttm_incomplete, quote_missing, quote_stale, currency_conversion_missing, adr_ratio_unverified, share_basis_unverified, custom_tag_review, source_conflict, upstream_unavailable. Block misleading per-share/market-upside outputs when quote, FX, ADR ratio or denominator cannot be reconciled. Forecast assumptions remain visibly user assumptions, not fetched facts.\n",
    "l-apis/stock-etfs-fundamental-data-feeds\n\n## UI／介面契約要求\n在自有後端使用 /api/companies?query= 與 /api/company/:symbol?asOf=...，或使用明確標示為快照的預建靜態快取。瀏覽器絕不取得供應商機密。於伺服器端驗證股票代號；不提供開放任意 URL 代理。除 SEC 明確不支援 CORS 外，其他供應商的 CORS 尚未確立；後端可避免此相依性並控制授權／快取政策。\n\n每個數值欄位：value（number|null）、單位／幣別、periodStart、periodEnd、periodType（FY/Q/TTM/instant）、filedAt、acceptedAt、accession、form、sourceUrl、sourceTag、status（reported/derived/missing/conflict）、derivation 與 components。身分：symbol、cik、exchange、securityType、reportingCurrency、quoteCurrency、shareClass、ordinarySharesPerDepositaryShare 及驗證來源。\n\n將 quote.priceAsOf 與財務 periodEnd 及 fetchedAt 分開。包括 lastSuccessfulRefreshAt、latestFilingCheckedAt、nextCheckAt、cacheAge、provider、providerLicenseMode、status 與 missingFields。報價：price 可為 null、原始／調整基礎、幣別、時間戳記、延遲、來源 URL。不可僅因今天取得資料，就將舊快照標示為即時或目前資料。\n\n品質旗標：annual_only、ttm_incomplete、quote_missing、quote_stale、currency_conversion_missing、adr_ratio_unverified、share_basis_unverified、custom_tag_review、source_conflict、upstream_unavailable。無法調節報價、FX、ADR 比率或分母時，停用會造成誤導的每股／市場上漲空間輸出。預測假設應始終明確呈現為使用者假設，而非擷取事實。\n"
