    "Chosen because the frozen research explicitly supplies bounded downside/base/upside narratives, and the selected source path is the most interpretable reference mode. Endpoints and density shape are subjective elicitation choices. This does not mean the endpoints bound all economically possible outcomes. Not chosen: no defensible standard deviation or Gaussian tail calibration is in the sources, and apparent numeric precision would be misleading. Not chosen: there is no case for equal plausibility across the entire range when a specifically reviewed central schedule exists. A lognormal can be sensible for multiplicative gross unit costs with an evidenced right tail. These factors scale NET investment, a difference between gross spending and depreciation plus working capital, and are derived from named bounded budget scenarios. No empirical net-investment lognormal is established. Bounded triangular is therefore a reasonable subjective stress parameter rather than merely an engine accommodation. Add cohort-level gross-cost lognormal support only if evidence supports it.",
    "採用此分布，是因為凍結版本研究明確提供有界的下行／基準／上行敘事，而所選來源路徑是最容易解讀的參考眾數。端點與密度形狀都是主觀設定選擇，並不表示端點涵蓋所有經濟上可能的結果。未採用的理由：來源中沒有可辯護的標準差或高斯尾端校準，表面上的數字精確度會造成誤導。未採用的理由：既有經過專門審核的中央時程，就沒有理由假定整個區間各處同樣可能。若有右尾證據，對乘法性的單位總成本採用對數常態分布可能合理。這些因子縮放的是淨投資（NET investment），即總支出減折舊再加營運資金，且源自具名的有界預算情境。尚未建立淨投資服從對數常態的實證。因此，有界三角分布是合理的主觀壓力參數，而不只是為了配合引擎。唯有證據支持時，才加入批次層級總成本的對數常態支援。"
